  "body": "Welcome to the ultimate blend of contemporary design, effortless comfort, and premium Red Beach living. Built in 2021, this beautifully crafted 3-bedroom home offers a sleek, low-maintenance lifestyle tailored for busy professionals, downsizers, or young families wanting to secure their slice of the Coast.\r\n\r\nStep inside and discover a clever, highly functional floor plan designed to maximize space and privacy. Downstairs features a spacious, private bedroom complete with its own modern ensuite - the perfect setup for teenagers, guests, a home office, or flatmate situation. Step outside to an expansive deck and garden area - the ultimate setup for summer BBQs, evening wine, and alfresco dining.\r\n\r\nUpstairs, the heart of the home opens up into a light-filled, open-plan living, dining, and kitchen area. The modern kitchen flows seamlessly into the living area and out onto the deck, offering a perfect spot for your morning coffee. Two additional double bedrooms and a stylish family bathroom complete this upper level.\r\n\r\nParking is a breeze with a secure single garage plus the bonus of off-street parking for two additional vehicles.\r\n\r\nLocated in the highly desirable Red Beach community, you are just moments away from the beach, local schooling, public transport, and the vibrant Silverdale shopping hub.\r\n\r\nThe vendors are ready for their next chapter, meaning this pristine home is ready for yours. Call today to arrange your viewing!",
